1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,210
[4 years ago]

2
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:31,800
He may not be able to draw again.

3
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:44,240
Please...

4
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:50,050
Please, stay away from him.

5
00:00:51,310 --> 00:00:53,570
If you stay,

6
00:00:53,570 --> 00:00:55,540
he will break.

7
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,110
Lun...

8
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:16,140
You're awake?

9
00:01:17,010 --> 00:01:18,610
Do you want to sit up?

10
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:53,010
What do you know?

11
00:01:53,740 --> 00:01:56,550
I knew about the man named Lun.

12
00:01:57,100 --> 00:01:59,120
Did you also know about 203?

13
00:01:59,860 --> 00:02:01,530
Yeah.

14
00:02:01,530 --> 00:02:03,180
For how long?

15
00:02:03,180 --> 00:02:05,530
Since before we started dating.

16
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:09,020
Why didn't you ever tell me?

17
00:02:09,650 --> 00:02:12,450
Because you said you didn't want to remember.

18
00:02:12,450 --> 00:02:14,980
- Me?
- Yeah.

19
00:02:16,590 --> 00:02:21,520
Your mother also asked me
not to force the knowledge onto you.

20
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:24,070
Even if I asked to know?

21
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:30,300
We thought if you remembered,
you'd only suffer again.

22
00:02:33,550 --> 00:02:36,480
That's...

23
00:02:38,690 --> 00:02:41,600
That's not your decision to make.

24
00:02:46,310 --> 00:02:47,810
I'm sorry.

25
00:02:54,220 --> 00:02:56,720
We lived here, together.

26
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,680
Did you know that, too?

27
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,050
Yeah.

28
00:03:06,940 --> 00:03:09,010
How much do you know?

29
00:03:10,380 --> 00:03:11,480
Not everything.

30
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:13,770
Then what don't you know?

31
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:19,820
I don't know what happened
the day of the accident.

32
00:03:23,020 --> 00:03:24,610
The accident?

33
00:03:25,340 --> 00:03:28,020
That's what you're trying to recall, right?

34
00:03:46,940 --> 00:03:48,800
Did you sleep?

35
00:03:51,010 --> 00:03:52,780
A bit.

36
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:55,410
Liar.

37
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:19,070
I was always by your side.

38
00:04:19,070 --> 00:04:21,440
Nights you couldn't sleep,

39
00:04:22,780 --> 00:04:24,850
days you couldn't paint, always.

40
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:30,200
But she forgot you.

41
00:04:31,810 --> 00:04:34,240
She forgot, and adopted a new life.

42
00:04:37,900 --> 00:04:40,080
Even though you forgot,

43
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:45,870
you've never really gotten over her.

44
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:53,420
I know.

45
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:04,440
I know how important she is to you.

46
00:05:09,230 --> 00:05:11,210
But all I want...

47
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:17,040
is for you to live.

48
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:23,690
I don't mind if you become unable to paint.

49
00:05:26,190 --> 00:05:28,380
As long as you live,

50
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:32,050
it's enough for me.

51
00:05:37,860 --> 00:05:39,450
Lun.

52
00:05:43,610 --> 00:05:45,720
Please. Stay with me.

53
00:05:55,610 --> 00:05:58,240
Don't see her anymore.

54
00:06:09,060 --> 00:06:10,620
Alright.

55
00:06:10,620 --> 00:06:12,120
Really?

56
00:06:13,770 --> 00:06:15,910
I won't see her anymore.

57
00:06:19,750 --> 00:06:21,130
That's great.

58
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:34,750
They're not coming out.

59
00:06:34,750 --> 00:06:37,520
- Too bad.
- Yeah.

60
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:40,760
I really wanted to get a picture
with the pandas...

61
00:06:40,760 --> 00:06:44,080
Why not try waiting a bit longer?

62
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:51,090
It's not so bad, sitting and waiting.

63
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:53,960
Yeah, it feels nice.

64
00:07:03,610 --> 00:07:05,100
There they are!

65
00:07:12,220 --> 00:07:14,270
How unusual.

66
00:07:14,270 --> 00:07:15,460
What?

67
00:07:15,460 --> 00:07:17,980
You're making a terrifying face.

68
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:20,380
Am I?

69
00:07:23,110 --> 00:07:24,760
Your girlfriend?

70
00:07:26,500 --> 00:07:28,100
Yeah.

71
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:33,840
Oh, to have someone worry for you.
She's a lucky girl.

72
00:07:35,750 --> 00:07:38,360
It doesn't feel great
to be the one worrying though.

73
00:07:39,370 --> 00:07:43,180
"Worry" is such a convenient word.

74
00:07:44,060 --> 00:07:47,170
It lets you hide away your fears.

75
00:07:47,170 --> 00:07:48,740
But I am scared.

76
00:07:53,180 --> 00:07:54,830
Of what?

77
00:07:57,450 --> 00:08:00,650
Not of Sakura remembering.

78
00:08:00,650 --> 00:08:04,900
But of her remembering, and not choose me.

79
00:08:04,900 --> 00:08:06,220
Then tell her.

80
00:08:06,220 --> 00:08:07,930
If I did, I'd be tying her down.

81
00:08:07,930 --> 00:08:12,410
You already are,
with how worried you're acting.

82
00:08:14,500 --> 00:08:18,060
Just because you're close,
doesn't mean you'll be chosen.

83
00:08:18,060 --> 00:08:19,780
What's that supposed to mean?

84
00:08:20,580 --> 00:08:22,680
I'm just making a general observation.

85
00:08:24,710 --> 00:08:29,430
If you want to be chosen,
at least tell her the truth.

86
00:08:34,040 --> 00:08:38,630
<i>She forgot, and adopted a new life.</i>

87
00:08:42,530 --> 00:08:44,530
Sakura...

88
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:51,550
<i>Please. Stay with me.</i>

89
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:58,170
I won't... see her anymore.

90
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:46,050
[Soak dishes in water before washing]
[Don't put away damp laundry]

91
00:09:46,050 --> 00:09:49,720
[Buy coffee beans before we run out]
[White pepper soup, only on rainy days]

92
00:09:53,900 --> 00:09:56,000
[On days Lun can't draw, make soup]
[Add extra white pepper]

93
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:57,950
[On days Lun can't draw, make soup]
[Add extra white pepper]

94
00:09:57,950 --> 00:10:02,140
[On rainy days, we go here]

95
00:10:10,550 --> 00:10:12,330
Here you go.

96
00:10:15,170 --> 00:10:16,920
Are you okay?

97
00:10:16,920 --> 00:10:18,300
Spicy!

98
00:10:18,300 --> 00:10:20,440
- Spicy?
- Yes!

99
00:10:33,830 --> 00:10:35,610
You alone?

100
00:10:38,010 --> 00:10:39,420
Coffee?

101
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:41,510
Yes.

102
00:10:57,220 --> 00:10:58,820
What's this?

103
00:10:58,820 --> 00:11:00,720
I don't know.

104
00:11:10,520 --> 00:11:12,730
I'm keeping it here,

105
00:11:12,730 --> 00:11:15,230
until it sells for a high price.

106
00:11:23,340 --> 00:11:24,840
"Lun"...

107
00:11:29,900 --> 00:11:32,350
What are you doing?

108
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:35,800
Practicing my signature.

109
00:11:35,800 --> 00:11:40,060
I'm trying to perfect it,
but... something's missing.

110
00:11:51,470 --> 00:11:53,000
How's that?
[Lun]

111
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:56,260
<i>Sakura?</i>

112
00:12:01,950 --> 00:12:04,000
Do you know this?

113
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:14,420
Yes.

114
00:12:14,420 --> 00:12:16,400
Should I go?

115
00:12:17,790 --> 00:12:19,650
You decide.

116
00:12:27,900 --> 00:12:31,660
[Tembeling Road]

117
00:12:38,630 --> 00:12:43,030
[Eita: Want me to come get you?]

118
00:12:43,030 --> 00:12:44,060
[It's fine]

119
00:12:44,060 --> 00:12:47,600
[I have somewhere I want to stop by]

120
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:51,850
[Eita: Okay, be careful]

121
00:12:57,130 --> 00:12:59,020
Let's get going.

122
00:13:02,980 --> 00:13:04,600
Eita?

123
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:06,460
What's up?

124
00:13:06,460 --> 00:13:08,430
Sorry. I have to head out a bit.

125
00:13:08,430 --> 00:13:10,350
Huh? But our meeting...

126
00:13:10,350 --> 00:13:12,000
I'll be back soon.

127
00:14:17,020 --> 00:14:19,510
I had a feeling you'd be here.

128
00:14:19,510 --> 00:14:21,050
Why?

129
00:14:21,780 --> 00:14:23,160
I don't know.

130
00:14:23,160 --> 00:14:24,840
You don't?

131
00:14:25,610 --> 00:14:27,260
I don't.

132
00:14:35,700 --> 00:14:37,100
Here?

133
00:14:40,300 --> 00:14:43,400
Over there feels too far from you.

134
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:27,050
Thank you.

135
00:15:34,980 --> 00:15:36,910
I eat first?

136
00:15:38,180 --> 00:15:40,940
I felt like you went first.

137
00:15:40,940 --> 00:15:43,640
You always say, "I feel".

138
00:15:44,520 --> 00:15:46,510
Only with you.

139
00:15:49,100 --> 00:15:53,050
Sorry. That kinda just came out.

140
00:16:07,300 --> 00:16:10,320
It's not like I want to remember, but...

141
00:16:12,040 --> 00:16:15,130
It reacts first.

142
00:16:15,610 --> 00:16:17,450
What does?

143
00:16:17,450 --> 00:16:23,160
My hands. Smells. Before I do.

144
00:16:24,170 --> 00:16:25,630
Yeah.

145
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,530
Me too.

146
00:16:55,580 --> 00:16:58,190
You knew when I couldn't paint.

147
00:16:58,920 --> 00:17:00,900
Did you remember?

148
00:17:00,900 --> 00:17:02,580
No.

149
00:17:06,130 --> 00:17:08,950
I'm hurting you,

150
00:17:10,500 --> 00:17:12,600
because I don't remember.

151
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:18,940
You still hurt, because you don't remember.

152
00:17:22,140 --> 00:17:24,060
It's cruel.

153
00:17:25,650 --> 00:17:27,150
Isn't it?

154
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:35,810
It's cruel either way.

155
00:17:35,810 --> 00:17:38,740
Today is special secret recipe!

156
00:17:38,740 --> 00:17:42,190
What? You said yesterday was secret.

157
00:17:42,190 --> 00:17:44,410
Today is very secret!

158
00:17:44,410 --> 00:17:47,470
Okay, okay. Really secret. I won't ask.

159
00:17:47,470 --> 00:17:50,390
The secret is...

160
00:17:54,620 --> 00:17:56,480
Sakura...

161
00:17:56,480 --> 00:18:00,210
Don't say my name.

162
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:03,280
Sorry.

163
00:18:07,550 --> 00:18:09,380
I need to get going.

164
00:18:11,490 --> 00:18:12,830
I'll walk you home.

165
00:18:12,830 --> 00:18:14,740
Don't.

166
00:18:18,490 --> 00:18:20,170
Please, don't.

167
00:18:57,270 --> 00:18:58,850
Sorry.

168
00:19:00,500 --> 00:19:02,820
My body just reacted.

169
00:19:02,820 --> 00:19:05,120
That's why I'm scared.

170
00:19:08,750 --> 00:19:10,940
I have Eita.

171
00:19:11,740 --> 00:19:13,740
I know.

172
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:15,800
You, too.

173
00:19:15,800 --> 00:19:17,360
Yeah.

174
00:19:17,360 --> 00:19:22,300
So we have to stop here.

175
00:19:22,300 --> 00:19:26,020
Even if we remember.

176
00:19:26,020 --> 00:19:28,430
We'll just hurt someone.

177
00:19:29,360 --> 00:19:30,960
Maybe.

178
00:19:31,570 --> 00:19:33,080
Maybe...

179
00:19:34,380 --> 00:19:36,430
But when I'm with you,

180
00:19:37,530 --> 00:19:39,700
I don't need to paint.

181
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:42,440
What do you mean?

182
00:19:43,840 --> 00:19:45,410
I don't know.

183
00:19:47,030 --> 00:19:49,820
But for the first time in my life,

184
00:19:49,820 --> 00:19:52,720
I can look at you, and not paint you.

185
00:20:20,800 --> 00:20:22,970
You should go home.

186
00:20:30,080 --> 00:20:31,670
I know.

187
00:20:39,210 --> 00:20:40,800
Sakura!

188
00:20:40,800 --> 00:20:42,340
I said, don't call my...

189
00:20:42,340 --> 00:20:44,800
I'm glad I met you now.

190
00:20:44,800 --> 00:20:46,940
Not the you from before.

191
00:20:48,770 --> 00:20:51,010
I like who you are now!

192
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:55,210
That's playing dirty.

193
00:20:58,390 --> 00:21:00,640
I haven't remembered a thing.

194
00:21:01,620 --> 00:21:04,170
I don't even understand.

195
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:06,970
So why...

196
00:21:07,750 --> 00:21:10,540
Why does it hurt more now?

197
00:21:15,560 --> 00:21:17,350
Sakura.

198
00:21:18,570 --> 00:21:21,150
It's not as though I remember.

199
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:31,120
But right now, I...

200
00:22:12,810 --> 00:22:14,200
Sorry.

201
00:22:16,210 --> 00:22:18,190
Don't apologize.

202
00:22:20,010 --> 00:22:24,390
If you say sorry, it feels like a mistake.

203
00:22:35,260 --> 00:22:36,900
I'm going home.

204
00:22:48,950 --> 00:22:56,990
[Next]
